"reading-code-speed":{"description":{"zh":"会变成多少条指令、会在哪里停、比的是不是同一个程序跑完的时间。","en":"How many instructions, where it will stall, and whether you are comparing the time to run the same program."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-a-cpu-runs-a-program/#ch12","lessons":[{"slug":"how-a-cpu-runs-a-program","step":null,"anchor":"ch12","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["怎么判断代码快不快","比较 CPU 性能看什么","怎么看编译出来的汇编"],"en":["how to tell if code is fast","how to compare CPU performance","how to read compiler output"]}},
"shared-data-checklist":{"description":{"zh":"会被几个线程写？在弱内存模型的机器上测过吗？等锁的人多吗？一致性是硬件给的，正确性和速度要自己挣。","en":"How many threads write it? Has it run on a weakly ordered machine? How many wait for the lock? Coherence comes from the hardware; correctness and speed are up to you."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-cores-share-memory/#ch12","lessons":[{"slug":"how-cores-share-memory","step":null,"anchor":"ch12","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["多线程共享变量怎么写","多线程程序怎么写才快"],"en":["how to write shared data in multithreaded code","making multithreaded code fast"]}},
